          "id": "b01",
          "text": "Let's solve this one step by step. Seven minus three x equals two x minus eight. Solve for x.",
          "display": "7 − 3x = 2x − 8",
          "cue": "show-problem",
          "pause_after_s": 1.2
        }
      ]
